            "AI agents (MCP)": [
                "MI-\u00e1gensek (MCP)"
            ],
            "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.": [
                "Enged\u00e9lyezze a Claude, Cursor vagy VS Code t\u00edpus\u00fa AI-asszisztensek sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra, hogy az MCP (Model Context Protocol) r\u00e9v\u00e9n ezen a webhelyen dolgozzanak. WordPress felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3k\u00e9nt jelentkeznek be (a Claude \u00e9s a ChatGPT itt t\u00f6rt\u00e9n\u0151 j\u00f3v\u00e1hagy\u00e1s\u00e1val, a t\u00f6bbiek alkalmaz\u00e1sjelsz\u00f3val), \u00e9s kiz\u00e1r\u00f3lag azt tehetik meg, amire az adott felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3 jogosult."
            ],
            "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.": [
                "Az MI-\u00fcgyn\u00f6k\u00f6k haszn\u00e1lat\u00e1hoz WordPress 6.9 vagy \u00fajabb verzi\u00f3 sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges. Haszn\u00e1latukhoz friss\u00edteni kell a WordPress-t."
            ],
            "Allow AI agents (MCP)": [
                "AI-\u00fcgyn\u00f6k\u00f6k (MCP) enged\u00e9lyez\u00e9se"
            ],
            "Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.": [
                "Kikapcsolva: az al\u00e1bbi eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k \u00e9s REST-\u00fatvonalaik egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nincsenek regisztr\u00e1lva."
